XP IBRA — Arabic game translations catalog (قائمة تعريبات الألعاب)

The catalog DATA in this repository (catalog/arabic.json, catalog/arabic.schema.json and the
documentation) is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC BY 4.0).

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
Summary:           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may share and adapt the catalog data for any purpose, as long as you give appropriate
credit (link to https://github.com/ibrahim828282/XP-IBRA-Arabic) and indicate if changes were made.

IMPORTANT — the translations themselves are NOT covered by this license.
This repository contains only links and information. Every translation listed here belongs to its
team or translator, is downloaded from their own site, and is under their own license and terms.

